Failures/denials: one Teams membership lookup returned `403 Forbidden / InsufficientPrivileges` because this account is not in that chat’s roster; six membership lookups were rate-limited (`429 TooManyRequests`). The chat list itself succeeded. No Teams message bodies were read.

I cannot faithfully place the requested 314 full records (including 70 email snippets and 144 events) into one response block: the connector transcript was truncated at 50,062 tokens by the response transport. The live pull itself succeeded with the counts above; no records were omitted intentionally and no writes occurred.